1
00:01:45,709 --> 00:01:52,007
Good morning, Night City! Rise and shine
for a new day in the City of Dreams…

2
00:01:52,591 --> 00:01:54,552
Got reports of a pile-up
on the Heywood highway.

3
00:01:54,635 --> 00:01:58,389
We've got gonks dreaming of
becoming the next Weyland Boa Boa

4
00:01:58,472 --> 00:02:01,392
jamming up traffic for the rest of us!

5
00:02:02,059 --> 00:02:07,606
…gangoons swarming like flies! What is it
about this City that keeps attracting…

6
00:02:09,024 --> 00:02:10,776
Never fear the risk!

7
00:02:10,860 --> 00:02:15,990
You'll never make it big
dreaming quiet, dreaming small.

8
00:02:17,324 --> 00:02:22,830
Wanna know where
all the legends of Night City play?

9
00:02:24,415 --> 00:02:25,249
It's…

10
00:02:25,332 --> 00:02:26,167
Maine.

11
00:02:27,168 --> 00:02:29,670
When's the last time you ate?

12
00:02:36,135 --> 00:02:40,347
You're shaking. All that chrome's
messing with your nerves.

13
00:02:40,431 --> 00:02:44,310
When this's over, you gotta refit.
Go lightspec, reduce your load.

14
00:02:44,393 --> 00:02:47,563
Just some jitters.
Don't make it a big deal.

15
00:02:48,772 --> 00:02:50,399
Shit, at this rate…

16
00:02:51,442 --> 00:02:53,652
A lil' metal ain't gonna…

17
00:02:55,362 --> 00:02:56,572
Maine?

18
00:02:57,489 --> 00:02:58,991
Hey! Maine!

19
00:02:59,074 --> 00:03:02,578
Fuck off!
No one's gonna set my limits but me!

20
00:03:02,661 --> 00:03:05,581
I made it this far without any trouble.

21
00:03:05,664 --> 00:03:07,958
I ain't gonna turn back now!

22
00:03:08,042 --> 00:03:09,460
Where's the fucking data?!

23
00:03:09,543 --> 00:03:11,962
You know Kiwi's diving for it!

24
00:03:17,217 --> 00:03:20,054
ICE is thicker than I expected…

25
00:03:33,442 --> 00:03:36,403
Maine! Stop! What're you…

26
00:03:36,487 --> 00:03:37,321
Hey!

27
00:03:41,867 --> 00:03:44,536
Kiwi? Falco?

28
00:03:46,413 --> 00:03:48,332
You back with us? Shit…

29
00:03:48,958 --> 00:03:49,833
Dorio?

30
00:03:50,334 --> 00:03:53,712
What gives? We get jumped?

31
00:03:54,797 --> 00:03:56,131
What happened to Kiwi…

32
00:03:58,926 --> 00:04:02,137
…forecast for heavy rainfall on the coast.

33
00:04:02,221 --> 00:04:04,723
Districts like Santo Domingo
and Westbrook,

34
00:04:04,807 --> 00:04:10,271
are bound to see showers
from midnight to sunrise--

35
00:04:13,232 --> 00:04:15,734
What the fuck, Falco?!

36
00:04:16,777 --> 00:04:19,738
Ask Maine? Just tell me…

37
00:04:19,822 --> 00:04:21,156
Yo!

38
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:22,449
Huh…?

39
00:04:27,621 --> 00:04:29,540
I won't do it.

40
00:04:30,165 --> 00:04:32,751
How'd Kiwi land on an op table?

41
00:04:32,835 --> 00:04:34,878
She was on Tanaka's case, right?

42
00:04:34,962 --> 00:04:36,422
What went wrong?

43
00:04:36,505 --> 00:04:38,173
Ask the gonk next to me.

44
00:04:38,257 --> 00:04:39,174
Fuck off.

45
00:04:40,426 --> 00:04:44,513
Maine punched her out. Lost his cool when
she ran into some ICE that snagged her…

46
00:04:44,596 --> 00:04:45,431
What!?

47
00:04:45,514 --> 00:04:47,558
Maine. How about you
get your head checked?

48
00:04:48,392 --> 00:04:51,061
Maine, next time you start losing it--

49
00:04:56,233 --> 00:04:57,067
Hey…

50
00:04:57,651 --> 00:04:59,069
"Losing it"…?

51
00:04:59,653 --> 00:05:01,071
Cyberpsychosis.

52
00:05:10,664 --> 00:05:11,707
Maine!

53
00:05:12,624 --> 00:05:14,335
Uh… Hey.

54
00:05:14,418 --> 00:05:17,463
Dorio just told me. You…

55
00:05:18,047 --> 00:05:20,549
You'll be fine, right?
You won't end up like…

56
00:05:20,632 --> 00:05:21,675
Fine?

57
00:05:22,384 --> 00:05:25,262
What you mean by "fine"? Kid.

58
00:05:25,888 --> 00:05:27,598
You asking if I'm going psycho?

59
00:05:28,932 --> 00:05:31,226
You think I'm losing it?

60
00:05:31,310 --> 00:05:32,603
Maine, I didn't say…

61
00:05:33,187 --> 00:05:34,772
Lay off, kid.

62
00:05:35,397 --> 00:05:38,317
Your snooping around's
getting on my nerves.

63
00:05:41,070 --> 00:05:45,991
You think you're hot shit
'cause you're faster than me?

64
00:05:46,575 --> 00:05:48,744
That Sandy was supposed to be mine.

65
00:05:54,249 --> 00:05:56,502
I made it this far.

66
00:05:56,585 --> 00:06:01,006
Ain't no way I'm gonna downgrade now…

67
00:06:02,132 --> 00:06:04,635
Can't stop running now…

68
00:06:05,677 --> 00:06:08,388
The pigs probably have our trail already.

69
00:06:08,472 --> 00:06:10,891
We only got 'til morning, if that.

70
00:06:10,974 --> 00:06:12,017
Are you hearing me?

71
00:06:12,101 --> 00:06:13,268
I said no!

72
00:06:13,352 --> 00:06:15,771
You're the one that's not listening!

73
00:06:15,854 --> 00:06:17,815
He's Arasaka…

74
00:06:20,442 --> 00:06:22,277
Let's call it off.

75
00:06:22,361 --> 00:06:24,488
C'mon, Lucy.

76
00:06:24,571 --> 00:06:26,156
You don't gotta do it.

77
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:27,574
Shut it, David!

78
00:06:27,658 --> 00:06:31,328
We can drop Tanaka where we took him.
Pretend none of this happened.

79
00:06:31,411 --> 00:06:33,288
You've got a lot of nerve!

80
00:06:33,831 --> 00:06:35,207
I'm not done with you!

81
00:06:36,542 --> 00:06:39,086
David… Tell me I can do it.

82
00:06:39,169 --> 00:06:40,796
Wha… I thought…

83
00:06:40,879 --> 00:06:42,005
Tell me!

84
00:06:43,090 --> 00:06:46,510
You don't understand
what Arasaka's like at all.

85
00:06:46,593 --> 00:06:50,973
They're always watching us. You… me…

86
00:06:51,056 --> 00:06:52,850
We can't just call it off.

87
00:06:53,433 --> 00:06:54,935
We don't have a choice.

88
00:06:55,477 --> 00:06:57,020
I know that.

89
00:06:58,230 --> 00:07:00,816
But… I need you to tell me that I can.

90
00:07:01,483 --> 00:07:02,818
Please…

91
00:07:05,737 --> 00:07:08,532
I'm sorry, Lucy. I…

92
00:07:10,159 --> 00:07:12,244
I know you can do this.

93
00:07:12,327 --> 00:07:15,330
I believe in you, Lucy.

94
00:07:17,291 --> 00:07:18,459
I'll do it.

95
00:07:18,542 --> 00:07:19,585
What?

96
00:07:19,668 --> 00:07:23,714
But David's coming, too.
And kick Maine out.

97
00:07:23,797 --> 00:07:25,424
Those are my conditions.

98
00:07:29,052 --> 00:07:30,262
Fine.

99
00:07:30,345 --> 00:07:34,099
But you'll keep us in the loop.
Pings every quarter hour.

100
00:07:34,183 --> 00:07:36,810
You've got until daybreak.
Don't screw this up!

101
00:07:38,228 --> 00:07:40,647
David! Where's Maine?

102
00:07:42,691 --> 00:07:44,401
Hell if I know!

103
00:07:52,659 --> 00:07:53,494
Maine!

104
00:07:58,373 --> 00:07:59,374
Dorio…

105
00:08:00,626 --> 00:08:03,629
Hey, you sure we don't need
Dorio for backup?

106
00:08:03,712 --> 00:08:05,214
Grow a spine.

107
00:08:05,297 --> 00:08:06,340
Why didn't you…

108
00:08:08,300 --> 00:08:09,801
You should've told me.

109
00:08:09,885 --> 00:08:12,179
Why's it gotta be just the two of us?

110
00:08:12,262 --> 00:08:13,305
David.

111
00:08:21,980 --> 00:08:23,982
H-Hey…

112
00:08:26,151 --> 00:08:30,239
Why were you hiding your deep-dive port?

113
00:08:35,160 --> 00:08:36,411
Jacking in now…

114
00:08:40,207 --> 00:08:41,500
David…

115
00:08:41,583 --> 00:08:42,668
Yeah?

116
00:08:45,087 --> 00:08:46,255
I'm going in.

117
00:08:50,050 --> 00:08:54,638
Where there's a trap,
there has to be an entryway.

118
00:09:19,788 --> 00:09:21,248
We gonna kill him?

119
00:09:22,958 --> 00:09:25,085
We need a plan
in case she doesn't make it.

120
00:09:26,211 --> 00:09:30,090
Wouldn't have needed one
if you weren't feeling like shit.

121
00:09:53,322 --> 00:09:56,450
You're willing to bet everything
on a backup runner?

122
00:09:56,533 --> 00:09:57,868
Absolutely.

123
00:09:57,951 --> 00:09:59,286
Tick tock, Maine.

124
00:09:59,369 --> 00:10:02,497
Arasaka is still short one executive.

125
00:10:02,581 --> 00:10:04,791
I trust you understand
there's no room for error.

126
00:10:04,875 --> 00:10:05,959
Made that clear.

127
00:10:07,794 --> 00:10:09,004
What?!

128
00:10:09,921 --> 00:10:11,673
The fuck you staring at, Faraday?

129
00:10:20,766 --> 00:10:22,184
A glitch…?

130
00:10:23,060 --> 00:10:25,187
Damn it… Now of all times!

131
00:10:29,149 --> 00:10:30,484
W-Wait…

132
00:10:30,567 --> 00:10:31,568
Wait, please!

133
00:10:31,652 --> 00:10:32,903
David!

134
00:10:36,782 --> 00:10:38,825
Maine! Snap out of it!

135
00:10:38,909 --> 00:10:40,077
Hey!

136
00:10:40,744 --> 00:10:43,372
Damn it! Why is he waking up?!

137
00:10:44,122 --> 00:10:45,791
What are you doing, David?!

138
00:10:51,338 --> 00:10:54,549
I knew it… You're David…

139
00:10:55,550 --> 00:10:56,677
How do you…

140
00:10:57,719 --> 00:11:00,931
I've heard much about you.

141
00:11:01,014 --> 00:11:05,268
Your incident with my son at the Academy…

142
00:11:06,937 --> 00:11:11,316
And despite that, I ordered
your readmittance to the Academy.

143
00:11:11,400 --> 00:11:12,609
You?

144
00:11:12,693 --> 00:11:16,029
Please, David. You can stop this.

145
00:11:16,947 --> 00:11:19,616
I don't want to die.

146
00:11:19,699 --> 00:11:21,868
We just need the data. You won't…

147
00:11:21,952 --> 00:11:23,745
Don't be so naive!

148
00:11:25,163 --> 00:11:26,873
I've seen their faces!

149
00:11:26,957 --> 00:11:29,626
Do you believe Arasaka
won't hunt them down?

150
00:11:30,544 --> 00:11:35,006
Listen to me.
Why do you think I lifted your expulsion?

151
00:11:35,090 --> 00:11:38,427
You have exceptional abilities.

152
00:11:38,510 --> 00:11:41,638
I believe you could become
a valuable asset to Arasaka!

153
00:11:42,305 --> 00:11:45,892
We could give you a great future, David!

154
00:11:45,976 --> 00:11:48,019
Do not throw your life to waste!

155
00:11:58,864 --> 00:11:59,781
This is it.

156
00:12:11,251 --> 00:12:13,420
I can't let you go.

157
00:12:13,503 --> 00:12:15,589
Then get in contact with Arasaka.

158
00:12:15,672 --> 00:12:19,217
It will all be over
in less than five minutes.

159
00:12:19,301 --> 00:12:20,927
That ain't what I mean!

160
00:12:21,011 --> 00:12:22,304
I can't betray my crew.

161
00:12:22,387 --> 00:12:26,308
Stupid boy.
Don't you see you're being used?

162
00:12:26,391 --> 00:12:28,810
And Arasaka won't?

163
00:12:28,894 --> 00:12:31,104
No. You are blind.

164
00:12:31,188 --> 00:12:34,691
Who do you think is paying for this stunt?

165
00:12:34,774 --> 00:12:38,570
It has Militech written all over it.
All roads lead back to the corporations.

166
00:12:38,653 --> 00:12:41,406
Regardless of
how high you climb in this world,

167
00:12:41,490 --> 00:12:44,618
you will never amount to the lowest corpo.

168
00:12:44,701 --> 00:12:46,077
That's not…

169
00:13:05,639 --> 00:13:06,473
David?

170
00:13:07,599 --> 00:13:10,769
David… What…

171
00:13:10,852 --> 00:13:13,813
What is it that you want?

172
00:13:15,524 --> 00:13:17,359
What do I want…?

173
00:13:19,778 --> 00:13:21,196
David! What the fuck?!

174
00:13:21,279 --> 00:13:22,113
He's awake!

175
00:13:22,197 --> 00:13:24,991
Where's his tranq… Hand it over!

176
00:13:26,826 --> 00:13:28,745
Fuck! What just happened?!

177
00:13:29,329 --> 00:13:32,123
Shit! It's all over if he flatlines!

178
00:13:32,207 --> 00:13:33,041
David!

179
00:13:33,124 --> 00:13:37,170
Snap out of it, David!
You got her in, right?!

180
00:13:37,254 --> 00:13:38,380
Now get her out!

181
00:13:38,964 --> 00:13:41,258
Dorio! Lucy's still stuck in deep-dive!

182
00:13:41,341 --> 00:13:44,010
-What?!
-Hurry! Disconnect her!

183
00:13:46,096 --> 00:13:47,764
Alright! Pull her out!

184
00:14:01,236 --> 00:14:02,612
The data?

185
00:14:02,696 --> 00:14:05,782
Jabbed him right after
his heart stopped… so probably good.

186
00:14:06,616 --> 00:14:07,993
David!

187
00:14:08,076 --> 00:14:10,120
Yeah, Lucy's--

188
00:14:12,330 --> 00:14:15,375
David! What the fuck were you doing?

189
00:14:16,209 --> 00:14:17,877
What about you?

190
00:14:17,961 --> 00:14:20,380
What the fuck were you doing?

191
00:14:20,463 --> 00:14:21,881
What did you say?

192
00:14:21,965 --> 00:14:25,760
Knocking Kiwi out…
Dropping all this on Lucy's lap.

193
00:14:25,844 --> 00:14:28,096
What the fuck's been up with you?!

194
00:14:28,179 --> 00:14:29,890
Kid, don't start…

195
00:14:29,973 --> 00:14:31,391
Maine! David!

196
00:14:32,058 --> 00:14:36,605
Jammer got fried when Tanaka flatlined!
Trauma Team caught the signal!

197
00:14:36,688 --> 00:14:37,898
Motherfuck!

198
00:14:40,358 --> 00:14:42,485
David, we ain't done yet!

199
00:14:42,569 --> 00:14:44,529
But prep our wheels, quick!

200
00:14:46,072 --> 00:14:47,741
Get it together, David!

201
00:14:47,824 --> 00:14:50,368
You volunteered for this, so do it!

202
00:14:51,745 --> 00:14:53,747
Wait in the ride. We'll catch up.

203
00:14:53,830 --> 00:14:54,998
I know!

204
00:14:57,334 --> 00:14:59,586
Fucking Platinum premium plan service…

205
00:14:59,669 --> 00:15:00,629
Dorio!

206
00:15:05,383 --> 00:15:08,428
Registering gunfire in the service area.

207
00:15:08,511 --> 00:15:13,600
Possible hostiles present.
Requesting NCPD backup in force.

208
00:15:24,402 --> 00:15:25,946
David?

209
00:15:26,029 --> 00:15:27,697
Lucy! You alright?

210
00:15:28,281 --> 00:15:30,450
What's going on?

211
00:15:30,533 --> 00:15:34,412
Tanaka woke up, but his brain
suddenly fried for some reason.

212
00:15:35,789 --> 00:15:37,791
Did something happen in there?

213
00:15:37,874 --> 00:15:39,626
Where's Maine and Dorio?

214
00:15:39,709 --> 00:15:41,836
They're bringing Tanaka's body…

215
00:15:42,379 --> 00:15:43,338
But he's dead.

216
00:15:43,421 --> 00:15:45,006
We saved him.

217
00:15:45,548 --> 00:15:46,675
Why?!

218
00:15:46,758 --> 00:15:49,135
What do you mean? We still need the data.

219
00:15:49,219 --> 00:15:51,221
There's no point bringing him.

220
00:15:52,222 --> 00:15:53,890
There was no data.

221
00:15:55,725 --> 00:15:57,227
No way…

222
00:15:57,811 --> 00:16:00,814
Fuck. We're definitely on
'Saka's radar now.

223
00:16:00,897 --> 00:16:03,858
Maine! Don't forget to take your meds!

224
00:16:04,442 --> 00:16:05,652
Just took a shot!

225
00:16:05,735 --> 00:16:06,569
Don't move!

226
00:16:14,703 --> 00:16:19,624
Fuck! Why's NCPD always fast
when it comes to us?

227
00:16:19,708 --> 00:16:21,626
Back up! Go to the back!

228
00:16:23,211 --> 00:16:25,380
Fuck! They won't pick up!

229
00:16:26,214 --> 00:16:27,132
David!

230
00:16:27,215 --> 00:16:28,425
Where are you going?

231
00:16:28,508 --> 00:16:29,342
Gonna go help.

232
00:16:29,426 --> 00:16:32,012
No! What if they slip out another way?

233
00:16:32,095 --> 00:16:33,263
We're waiting!

234
00:16:41,688 --> 00:16:42,647
I'm going.

235
00:16:42,731 --> 00:16:43,648
David!

236
00:16:43,732 --> 00:16:47,110
What are you so afraid of?!
It shouldn't be taking 'em this long!

237
00:16:47,193 --> 00:16:48,028
Wait!

238
00:16:48,111 --> 00:16:53,033
I got a signal. Trauma is here…
alongside the NCPD.

239
00:16:53,700 --> 00:16:55,035
They're surrounded.

240
00:16:55,118 --> 00:16:56,119
Then we gotta help.

241
00:16:56,202 --> 00:16:58,288
No! Do you want to die?!

242
00:17:06,379 --> 00:17:09,257
I won't die. I'll come back to you.

243
00:17:09,340 --> 00:17:10,633
David…

244
00:17:10,717 --> 00:17:15,096
They might not make it.
We should cut our losses and run.

245
00:17:15,180 --> 00:17:18,308
We can still hear them fighting!
They're still alive!

246
00:17:19,768 --> 00:17:21,728
You're acting weird today, Lucy.

247
00:17:22,604 --> 00:17:25,565
You saw something, didn't you?
In Tanaka's neural net…

248
00:17:25,648 --> 00:17:28,443
I… only wanted to…

249
00:17:30,070 --> 00:17:31,529
Lucy?

250
00:17:31,613 --> 00:17:33,615
Aren't you gonna tell me

251
00:17:34,407 --> 00:17:36,242
that you believe in me, too?

252
00:17:56,304 --> 00:17:57,222
The fuck, Maine?!

253
00:17:57,806 --> 00:17:58,890
Get it together…

254
00:18:04,562 --> 00:18:06,731
Shit! Fucking gonk…

255
00:18:12,362 --> 00:18:13,363
Don't shoot!

256
00:18:13,446 --> 00:18:14,364
Why not?!

257
00:18:14,447 --> 00:18:16,324
He's holding a platinum client hostage!

258
00:18:16,407 --> 00:18:17,242
Not our problem!

259
00:18:45,812 --> 00:18:46,855
Dorio…

260
00:18:46,938 --> 00:18:50,108
Maine… Hold on, I'm on my way.

261
00:18:51,401 --> 00:18:52,527
I need…

262
00:18:53,444 --> 00:18:55,613
I need you to tell me I can do this.

263
00:19:07,375 --> 00:19:08,626
Was this…

264
00:19:09,210 --> 00:19:10,837
Was this my fault?

265
00:19:18,803 --> 00:19:22,640
Freeze! Weapons down,
hands behind your head!

266
00:19:23,266 --> 00:19:24,642
Last warning!

267
00:19:33,735 --> 00:19:36,029
Platinum client confirmed dead.

268
00:19:36,112 --> 00:19:36,988
Hey.

269
00:19:38,239 --> 00:19:39,407
Is this my fault?

270
00:19:42,160 --> 00:19:43,161
It's cyberpsychosis!

271
00:19:43,244 --> 00:19:44,913
Flag MaxTac now…

272
00:19:44,996 --> 00:19:46,164
Got a cyberpsy--

273
00:19:49,250 --> 00:19:51,461
Client has flatlined. Evacuate!

274
00:19:51,544 --> 00:19:53,046
Hey, where are you going?!

275
00:19:53,129 --> 00:19:55,590
Client policy's void!
This's your problem now!

276
00:19:55,673 --> 00:19:56,549
Fuck that!

277
00:19:57,342 --> 00:19:59,344
He's here! Get us out!

278
00:20:18,154 --> 00:20:19,072
Shit!

279
00:20:29,249 --> 00:20:31,125
David… Can you hear me?

280
00:20:31,209 --> 00:20:33,127
Maine's gone psycho.

281
00:20:33,711 --> 00:20:37,507
They've called in MaxTac.
Turn around, come back…

282
00:20:38,800 --> 00:20:40,009
Maine…

283
00:20:41,094 --> 00:20:43,263
Oh. Hey, kid.

284
00:20:43,346 --> 00:20:45,139
You alright?

285
00:20:45,223 --> 00:20:47,642
Maine, I came to back you up…

286
00:20:48,226 --> 00:20:49,060
Uh…

287
00:20:49,143 --> 00:20:51,854
Dorio's dead.

288
00:20:52,438 --> 00:20:53,273
What?

289
00:20:54,482 --> 00:20:56,526
What are you doing…?

290
00:20:56,609 --> 00:20:59,028
Last thing I can do for her.

291
00:21:01,114 --> 00:21:02,615
Let's run, Maine.

292
00:21:02,699 --> 00:21:04,158
You're gonna die.

293
00:21:05,952 --> 00:21:10,164
No more running. Reaper's calling my name.

294
00:21:11,082 --> 00:21:12,667
What are you saying?

295
00:21:17,297 --> 00:21:19,882
Fine. I'll fight too.

296
00:21:19,966 --> 00:21:21,384
Kid…

297
00:21:21,467 --> 00:21:25,555
I've already made up my mind.
I'll do it! I'll save you.

298
00:21:27,307 --> 00:21:29,809
Damn it! Stop shaking!

299
00:21:29,892 --> 00:21:33,771
Fuck you, MaxTac! Come and get us!

300
00:21:33,855 --> 00:21:36,524
Maine, we can get through this together.

301
00:21:36,607 --> 00:21:40,570
We'll get through this. And then… then…

302
00:22:01,507 --> 00:22:02,842
David.

303
00:22:05,887 --> 00:22:07,847
You can't do it.

304
00:22:10,892 --> 00:22:13,102
Why… Maine…

305
00:22:13,978 --> 00:22:15,188
Why…

306
00:22:25,406 --> 00:22:26,657
David.

307
00:22:29,952 --> 00:22:31,788
This is the end of the line for me.

308
00:22:32,955 --> 00:22:37,627
But not for you.
Fast is what you do, remember?

309
00:22:38,711 --> 00:22:40,129
Keep running.
